The '''HHMods Vehicles''' plugin (part of the [[HHMods]] suite) adds five attachment types to the base game's [[Vehicles|vehicle system]].

== Attachments added ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Attachment !! Purpose
|-
| '''Gyroscope''' || Stability aid that flattens the center of mass. Helpful for tall or top-heavy builds.
|-
| '''Headlights''' || Vehicle-mounted directional light for night driving. UI panel for on / off.
|-
| '''Tow bar''' || Joint between two vehicle roots. Chain vehicles into convoys. Experimental under stress.
|-
| '''Collector''' || Auto-pickup for nearby loot into vehicle inventory. Draws extra power like a wheel.
|-
| '''Impact Shielding''' || Reduces damage from vehicle collisions and impacts.
|}

== Technical ==

* '''Gyroscope''': Harmony postfix on <code>Top_Info.Calculate_Mass_Center</code>.
* '''Headlights''': Unity <code>Light</code> component attached to the <code>Build_Info</code> transform.
* '''Tow bar''': Unity <code>HingeJoint</code> / <code>ConfigurableJoint</code> between vehicle roots. Save / load extension.
* '''Collector''': periodic sphere query, auto-insert via <code>Loot_Mgr</code>.
* '''Impact Shielding''': Harmony prefix on <code>Battle_Info.MinusHP(float)</code>.

